{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgr3AY2p3JE529sUmoaPR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cause: an opponent group with 2 far-apart liberties has no local witness, so it looks like it's in atari; the \"capture\" there is really a 2-stone self-atari, which then leads to the send-two-return-one cycle. Let me measure how often a capture-looking point that is also a self-atari point is a real capture vs. a false one.\n\n```python\nexec(open('/work/ana.py').read())\nfrom collections import Counter\nG=json.load(open('/work/pass_5/games.json')); Bd=np.load('/work/pass_5/boards.npy')\ndef tob(arr): return [1 if x==1 else (2 if x==-1 else 0) for x in arr]\ndef star_pl(b,v):\n    c=b[v]; return sum(e(b,q) for q in [v]+NB[v] if b[q]==c)\ncnt=Counter()\nfor gi,g in enumerate(G):\n    for k in range(10,len(g['moves']),3):\n        b=tob(Bd[gi,k]); col=1 if k%2==1 else 2  # side to move after ply k (ply 0 black)\n        ginfo={}\n        for p in range(81):\n            if b[p] and p not in ginfo:\n                gg,l=group(b,p); \n                info=(len(l), any(hv_witness(b,v) for v in gg), any(star_pl(b,v)>=3 for v in gg), len(gg))\n                for v in gg: ginfo[v]=info\n        for p in range(81):\n            if b[p]: continue\n            opp_adj=[ginfo[q] for q in NB[p] if b[q]==3-col]\n            flagged=[x for x in opp_adj if not x[1]]\n            if not flagged: continue\n            eps=sum(1 for q in NB[p] if b[q]==0)\n            own3=any(ginfo[q][2] for q in NB[p] if b[q]==col)\n            sa=(eps<=1 and not own3)\n            real=any(x[0]==1 for x in flagged)\n            size=max(x[3] for x in flagged if x[0]==1) if real else 0\n            cnt[('SA' if sa else 'noSA', 'real' if real else 'false', min(size,3))]+=1\nfor k in sorted(cnt): print(k,cnt[k])\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1942,"cache_read_input_tokens":227432,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1942},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7058487b-e813-4267-8caf-88948278edbe","uuid":"440e6ece-b03a-4271-b074-8e29b24c2154","timestamp":"2026-11-08T19:47:49.825Z","request_id":"req_011Cgr3AXoBRTXvQZGobHkbJ"}
